<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-PARIS-NICE SIXTH STAGE LEADING PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-PARIS-NICE SIXTH STAGE LEADING PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SISTERON, France 1997-03-14</dateline>
